<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Your Feedio Subscription Has Been Created</title>
    <style></style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-container">
      <div class="header">
        Your Feedio Subscription is Active!
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <p>Hello {{userName}},</p>
        <p>Great news! Your Feedio subscription has been successfully created
          and is now active.</p>
        <div class="details-box">
          <p><strong>Subscription Plan:</strong> {{subscriptionDetails}}</p>
          <p><strong>Status:</strong> Active</p>
          <p><strong>Start Date:</strong> {{startDate}}</p>
        </div>
        <p>With your
          {{subscriptionDetails}}, you now have access to all our premium
          features, including:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Advanced analytics</li>
          <li>Unlimited product reviews</li>
          <li>Priority customer support</li>
          <!-- Add more features as needed -->
        </ul>
        <p>If you have any questions about your subscription or need assistance,
          please don't hesitate to contact our support team.</p>
        <a href="{{dashboardUrl}}" class="cta-button">Go to My Dashboard</a>
        <p>Thank you for choosing Feedio. We're excited to help you grow your
          business!</p>
        <p>Best regards,</p>
        <p>The Feedio Team</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.
        <br />
        ©
        {{currentYear}}
        Feedio, All Rights Reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>